	(descr "Taoglas CGGBP.25.4.A.02 single-feed L1 wideband ceramic patch (GPS/Galileo L1, BeiDou B1I, GLONASS G1), 25.1 x 25.1 x 4 mm, feed pin 0.9 mm on the centre line 2.5 mm off centre. Land and clearances per datasheet SPE-14-8-071-G sec. 4.2-4.3: 1.0 mm plated hole, 1.2 mm top pad, 2.2 mm bottom pad; no copper within 3.0 mm dia on the top and inner layers, 3.5 mm dia on the bottom. Same land and feed position as the GVLB258.A. Tuned by Taoglas on a 70x70 mm ground plane (https://www.taoglas.com/datasheets/CGGBP.25.4.A.02.pdf)")
